  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.53 Designated prime wetlands",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.53 “Designated prime wetlands” means “prime wetlands” as defined in RSA 482-A:15, I-a, reprinted in Appendix C, that have been designated by a municipality pursuant to RSA 482-A:15 and Env-Wt 700.\n\nSource. #12953, eff 12-24-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 102.54)",
